---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Master Prediction Markets"
  description="Privacy policy for Master Prediction Markets. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your data."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Last updated: February 27, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p>
        Master Prediction Markets ("we", "us", "our") operates
        <strong>masterpredictionmarkets.com</strong>. This page explains what data we collect,
        how we use it, and your choices.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3>Analytics</h3>
      <p>
        We use <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> (property ID G-W07DSXGL25) to understand how
        visitors use the site. Google Analytics collects anonymized data such as pages visited,
        time on site, referral source, device type, and approximate geographic location. This
        data is aggregated and cannot identify you personally. You can opt out by installing the
        <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.
      </p>

      <h3>Newsletter</h3>
      <p>
        If you subscribe to our newsletter, we collect your <strong>email address</strong> via
        <a href="https://buttondown.com" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buttondown</a>. Your email is
        used solely to send our newsletter. You can unsubscribe at any time using the link in
        every email. We do not sell or share your email with third parties.
      </p>

      <h3>Advertising</h3>
      <p>
        We use <strong>Google AdSense</strong> to display ads. Google and its partners may use
        cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this site or other websites. You can
        opt out of personalized advertising at
        <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>
        or via <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We use cookies for analytics and advertising as described above. Most browsers let you
        block or delete cookies through their settings. Disabling cookies may affect site
        functionality.
      </p>

      <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this site are affiliate links to prediction market platforms including
        Kalshi and Polymarket. If you sign up through these links, we may earn a referral
        commission at no cost to you. Affiliate relationships do not influence our editorial
        content or market analysis.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We use the following third-party services that may collect data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — website analytics</li>
        <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — advertising</li>
        <li><strong>Buttondown</strong> — email newsletter</li>
        <li><strong>GitHub Pages / Vercel</strong> — website hosting</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Each service operates under its own privacy policy. We encourage you to review their
        policies for details on how they handle your data.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Analytics data is retained according to Google's default retention settings (14 months).
        Newsletter subscriber data is retained until you unsubscribe. We do not store any other
        personal data.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This site is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal
        information from children.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with
        an updated revision date.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this privacy policy? Email us at
        <strong>hello@masterpredictionmarkets.com</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
